  "prefLabel": "Geo 103.01 Duties and Responsibilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Geo 103.01 Duties and Responsibilities. The board shall administer the provisions of RSA 310-A:118-139 which include but are not limited to safeguarding life, health, and property, to promoting public welfare and maintaining a high standard of integrity regarding the practice of the profession of geology in this state.\n\nSource. #7524, eff 7-1-01",
